msgid "Salvatore Oscurato"
msgstr "Salvatore Oscurato"

#: data/io.github.stalvatero.Letter.metainfo.xml.in.in:12
msgid ""
"Letter is a GNOME mail client built on GTK 4 and libadwaita. It uses GNOME "
"Online Accounts and Evolution Data Server, the same stack as Calendar and "
"Contacts, so Google, Microsoft 365, Exchange, and IMAP accounts already "
"configured on the desktop appear here without a second setup."
msgstr ""
"Lettera è un client di posta GNOME basato su GTK 4 e libadwaita. Usa Account "
"online GNOME e Evolution Data Server, lo stesso stack di Calendario e "
"Contatti, così gli account Google, Microsoft 365, Exchange e IMAP già "
"configurati sul desktop compaiono qui senza una seconda configurazione."

#: data/io.github.stalvatero.Letter.metainfo.xml.in.in:19
msgid ""
"Read conversations, search, compose HTML mail, and get notifications. Add "
"accounts in Settings → Online Accounts. Letter needs GNOME 50 or later."
msgstr ""
"Leggi le conversazioni, cerca, componi posta HTML e ricevi notifiche. "
"Aggiungi gli account in Impostazioni → Account online. Lettera richiede "
"GNOME 50 o successivo."

#: data/io.github.stalvatero.Letter.metainfo.xml.in.in:61
msgid ""
"Third 1.0 release candidate. Soft archive, trash, move, and flags stay local "
"until the sync timer, F5, startup, or quit, with an on-disk mutation "
"registry so pending work survives a crash. Microsoft 365 Archive moves are "
"bulk and fast again (Camel freeze around transfer). Virtual Outbox for Send, "
"Drafts autosave every two minutes, and Flatpak ships a minimal Evolution + "
"evolution-ews stack for Graph mail in the sandbox."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.stalvatero.Letter.metainfo.xml.in.in:74
msgid ""
"Second 1.0 release candidate. Completes the German UI translation, fixes "
"Microsoft 365 bookmarks against Outlook Flag (not High Importance), shows a "
"compact badge for high-priority mail, and accepts localized search "
"operators. Also includes calendar invitation timezone and Accept/Decline "
"latency fixes from after rc.1."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.stalvatero.Letter.metainfo.xml.in.in:85
msgid ""
"First 1.0 release candidate. Daily-use mail with cache-first sync, undo for "
"archive, move and trash, Inbox on every startup, and an experimental Flatpak "
"bundle. Feedback and remaining translations welcome before 1.0.0."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.stalvatero.Letter.metainfo.xml.in.in:95
msgid ""
"First public beta: reading, composing, search, notifications, and GNOME "
"Online Accounts."
msgstr ""

